WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.320
Oh, that's came off Van Dijk,

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.720
and it is an opportunity,
and a goal is scored.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.240
They've played through Liverpool again here.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.080
It's two for Villarreal.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.960
Last 10 minutes of the first half-

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.880
and Liverpool have themselves a goal.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.960
Good header away at the near post.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.840
Won back really well by Ngumoha.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.360
Oh, and a chance!

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.160
Feel the noise!

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.800
Lovely ball, brilliantly done by Ngumoha,

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.120
and he goes on...

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.280
Oh, it's there!

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:56.720
Rio Ngumoha's brilliance carves out
another one for Liverpool.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:00.680
And they're off again,
looking to kill this one.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.880
It's irresistible from Liverpool.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.720
And it comes all the way through.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.120
Oluwaseyi has made it 4-3.

